      "post_id": "36009",
      "author_handle": "Wolfblass",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 10 months ago",
      "body": "Yesterday we took dd to Donna Nook in Lincolnshire which is a nature reserve on the Lincolnshire coast.\nEvery year for 5 -6 weeks from November thousands of Seals make the beach their homes to pup!\nIt really was amazing and they are so close to you!\nBoy were the noises they made eerie! Sounded like whaling ghosts, but dd was in her element and is now just pretending to be a seal pup constantly!\nThe bulls were huge but wow are they fast when they want to be! And they were so gorgeous.....\nI never expected there to be so many! But it truely was fabulous -even if a little cold!!",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-3409/#36009",
      "raw_file": "_raw/forums-deep/justparents/responses/fe1168f3b592580e2b8b.html",
